		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῠβέρν-ᾱσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>steering, pilotage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
