				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				10.72
			</span></i> (pl.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				12.28
			</span></i> (pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοῦ</span> by a god, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.162a
			</span></i>.</div>
